tier: C (floating point; no claim; no verdict)

# Reproduce from a clean checkout (paths relative to the repository root):
generating_command: cargo run --release --manifest-path exploration/triad_frustration_rs/Cargo.toml -- --mmin 2 --mmax 20 --mmax-c 14 --seeds 3 --out data/triad_frustration
analysis_command:   python3 exploration/triad_frustration_plot.py data/triad_frustration
controls_only:      cargo run --release --manifest-path exploration/triad_frustration_rs/Cargo.toml -- --controls-only

# Provenance of the committed data
rustc: rustc 1.97.1 (8bab26f4f 2026-07-14)
threads: 8 (results are independent of thread count: per-mode sums are stored, then reduced in
         index order, so the reduction is bitwise reproducible)
seeds: 1,2,3 (xorshift64*, written into the source; no wall-clock, no entropy)
git_commit_at_generation: c84f4172bff6d94d9c5452e78688ecb8046d33f9
note: the run was executed from a session scratchpad copy of the crate; the crate committed at
      exploration/triad_frustration_rs/ is byte-identical to it, and its controls were re-run from
      the repository path (P1/P2/P2b/P3 plus both demonstrated negatives: PASS).

sha256sum: d090dcf9d71f68893418e9e1de0bbd65c17617c8b8ea2cbfcec91116188567c6  data/triad_frustration/dm_readings.csv
